    "# Services of Test Brand Inc\n\nTest Brand Inc is a premium boutique software consulting firm specializing in:\n1. **Custom Software Engineering**: We build responsive web applications, mobile apps, and robust backend APIs.\n2. **Cloud Architecture**: We design scalable, highly-available infrastructure layouts on AWS, Google Cloud, and Azure.\n3. **AI & Machine Learning**: We design custom agent pipelines, retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) applications, and fine-tune large language models.\n\nFor project estimates, we offer a free 30-minute introductory call."
